guitar noise» (Windy & Carl, Azusa Plane, Yume Bitsu, Surface Of Eceon). El «glitch», techno ultra-minimal hecho de errores digitales: Autechre, Oval, Alva Noto, Pan Sonic, Fennesz, Boards Of Canada, Ryoji Ikeda, Matmos. El ambient puro y el ruido (Tetsu Inoue, Thomas Köner, Aube), los tocadiscos virtuosos (Otomo Yoshihide) y la vanguardia ambient (Paul Schütze, Eliane Radigue, Hood, Vibracathedral Orchestra, Sigur Rós).","color":"#2dd4bf","family":"Vanguardia, electrónica y ambient","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#ambient-glitch"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":222960902061331,"artist":"Delerium","artist_id":239654197865227,"title":"Stone Tower","year":1990,"ess":0,"yt":"DPuhVqYZjMk","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Ambient, drones y glitch","scene_id":223839571047121,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#ambient-glitch","chapters":["Sección 6.22"],"pages":[[1,297,null]]},{"id":84692739077938,"artist":"Delerium","artist_id":239654197865227,"title":"Spiritual Archives","year":1991,"ess":0,"yt":"zUE-qZgiXDQ","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Ambient, drones y glitch","scene_id":223839571047121,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#ambient-glitch","chapters":["Sección 6.22"],"pages":[[1,297,null]]},{"id":67381594771019,"artist":"Delerium","artist_id":239654197865227,"title":"Spheres","year":1994,"ess":0,"yt":"QWVjSx7DX-U","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Ambient, drones y glitch","scene_id":223839571047121,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#ambient-glitch","chapters":["Sección 6.22"],"pages":[[1,297,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","autho